<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Vishal-Ai</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #0b1020;
      color: white;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    header {
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #26304a;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 90px 20px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 48px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: #4f9cff;
    }

    .hero p {
      color: #b8c1d9;
      font-size: 18px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      background: #4f9cff;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 30px 20px 70px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #151d32;
      border: 1px solid #293552;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 15px;
    }

    .card h2 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #aeb8d0;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      color: #7f8aa5;
      border-top: 1px solid #26304a;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">Vishal-Ai 🤖</div>
  </header>

  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Welcome to <span>Vishal-Ai</span></h1>

    <p>
      आपका personal AI assistant.
      सवाल पूछें, ideas पाएँ और अपने काम को आसान बनाएँ।
    </p>

    <a href="#features" class="button">Get Started</a>
  </section>

  <section class="features" id="features">

    <div class="card">
      <h2>🤖 AI Assistant</h2>
      <p>अपने सवाल पूछें और AI से तुरंत जवाब पाएँ।</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>⚡ Fast</h2>
      <p>Simple और तेज़ interface के साथ आसान experience।</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>🔒 Private</h2>
      <p>आपके personal experience को ध्यान में रखकर बनाया गया interface।</p>
    </div>

  </section>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Vishal-Ai — Personal Assistant
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
